{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI am writing from The Hague, where the evening air is sharp and the city hums with a lively, French inflection. This morning I made the walk to Scheveningen. To stand at the edge of the North Sea is a profound experience; it is not the gentle, domestic waters of the Rhine, but a vast, indifferent force. One feels small before it, yet strangely grounded in one’s own existence. It is a reminder that nature is not merely a backdrop for our thoughts, but a reality with its own weight and dignity.\n\nAfterward, I spent the afternoon in the Bois and visited the picture gallery, which holds some fine works, though I confess I preferred the company of the French comedies in the evening. The wit is sharp, the acting vigorous. It is a pleasure to see art and life intertwined so openly.\n\nI think of you and the boys in Berlin. Please give my regards to Immanuel. I shall write again soon.\n\nYours ever,\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795218949,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":216,"prompt_tokens":954,"total_tokens":1170,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-QECHrStZwaLquFr5geziJftBEIwzR5nN","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":954,"prompt_ms":959.979,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0062672955974843,"prompt_per_second":993.7717387567852,"predicted_n":216,"predicted_ms":5123.854,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.831879069767442,"predicted_per_second":41.96060231224387}}